# (f) An IOC through 3 levels pays the taker fee on each; the rest is cancelled.
#
# Asks: 2 lots at 101.00, 3 at 102.00, 5 at 103.00. The strategy sends an IOC to buy 11 lots up to 103.00
# at 1; it arrives at 2:
#   2 @ 101.00 = 0.202, fee 0.000202, 9 left
#   3 @ 102.00 = 0.306, fee 0.000306, 6 left
#   5 @ 103.00 = 0.515, fee 0.000515, 1 left
#   the last lot has nothing at or below 103.00: cancelled (ioc_remainder)
# Total: position 0.010, cash -1.023, fees 0.001023.
# The synthetic asks it took stay gone (no impact decay) until the data changes a level: at 3 the data
# sets 103.00 to 4 lots, and the engine follows; 101.00, unchanged in the data, stays empty.

end 20
data 0 snapshot bid 100.00 0.001 ask 101.00 0.002 ask 102.00 0.003 ask 103.00 0.005
send 1 o1 buy ioc 103.00 0.011
data 3 depth ask 103.00 0.004

queue_at 2 ask 103.00 = empty
queue_at 3 ask 103.00 = syn 0.004
queue_at 3 ask 101.00 = empty

expect 2 3 o1 ack
expect 2 3 o1 fill 101.00 0.002 taker fee 0.000202 leaves 0.009
expect 2 3 o1 fill 102.00 0.003 taker fee 0.000306 leaves 0.006
expect 2 3 o1 fill 103.00 0.005 taker fee 0.000515 leaves 0.001
expect 2 3 o1 cancelled ioc_remainder
final position 0.010 cash -1.023 fees 0.001023
